 "notes": [
  "The post calls this 'my Ramapo DPC deck': 9th place on day 1 (only loss to Don Kitzman's Speed Deal) and 14th on day 2; for day 2 he swapped two Revolutions for 'Taws and Melas'. Dested as a RamapoCon III tournament deck.",
  "No objective and no starting section. Heading For The Medical Frigate is the starting interrupt. The strategy says starting effects vary every game but Insurrection is always started; no starting location is named, so no starting card or single starting effect is set.",
  "The 'Unknown Type' header line (the locations section) was dropped; the list totals 60 (11 locations, 18 characters, 2 starships, 12 interrupts, 16 effects, 1 weapon).",
  "Posted 'Tatooine Lars' Moisture Farm x2' dested the Light Premiere site; Don't Do That Again and Ounee Ta are Effects in 2001; the posted combos dested Do, Or Do Not & •Wise Advice, Shocking Information & •Grimtaash and Sorry About The Mess & •Blaster Proficiency.",
  "Byline Alan \"Serpent\" Sagan; the wiki's Alan Sagan won the 2000 Hoth North Ridge Regionals and the post says 'I'm from the north ridge'."
 ],
 "player_note": "For day 2 he swapped two Revolutions for Tawss and Melas (posted 'Taws and Melas') as anti-Speed Deal tech."
